OL,3,GNEWSADramatic Action Man images
OL,4,Apublished by widow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA widow has marked what would have been
OL,7,Fher late husband's 50th birthday by
OL,8,Fpublishing a book of his imaginative
OL,9,FAction Man photos.
OL,11,FSteve Gilmour, from Norwich, was a
OL,12,Fgraphic designer and had taken over 100
OL,13,Fphotos of the classic plastic toy
OL,14,Ffigures over two years in various
OL,15,Fimaginative poses.
OL,17,FHe died aged 45 in May 2022, less than
OL,18,Fa year since being diagnosed with a
OL,19,Frare brain tumour, a grade four
OL,20,Fgliosarcoma.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
